'''Invite Friends to get Moneko''' was a feature in [[The Battle Cats]] that allowed player to invite friends and unlock [[Moneko (Special Cat)|Moneko]] and [[Bean Cats (Special Cat)|Bean Cats]]. It was removed in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]].

This feature was about inputting friend codes of other players to receive in-game rewards, including Moneko. The feature was available since the very first version of Battle Cats. In [[Version 2.3 Update|Version 2.3]], a second unit, [[Bean Cats (Special Cat)|Bean Cats]], was added.

==Function==
After clearing [[Japan (Empire of Cats)|Japan]] in Empire of Cats Chapter 1, the player would receive 2 codes and a new button would be added to the [[Main Menu|title screen]], labelled "Invite friends to get Moneko". It allowed the player to input codes such as [[Serial Codes]].
*For the Moneko code, after 10 players have input it, Moneko would be unlocked.
*For the Bean Cats code, after 3 players have input it, Bean Cats would be unlocked.

